{
  "name": "piece_b_replay",
  "version": "0.1",
  "description": "Sanitized the underlying credential-leak research replay corpus. Synthetic shape-faithful credential and PII fixtures derived from the openai-privacy-filter characterization (108 sec-04 leak responses + multilingual + DLP supplements). No real credentials or PII present.",
